      items: [
        "Launch: C$89.99 per month (C$899.90 per year)",
        "Grow: C$149.99 per month (C$1,499.90 per year)",
        "Scale: C$349.99 per month (C$3,499.90 per year)",
        "Annual billing is 2 months free.",
        "Initial term: 6 months, then month to month, with 30 days notice.",
        "No setup fee for website plans.",
      ],
    },
    {
      heading: "What is included in a website plan",
      items: [
        "Domain",
        "Hosting",
        "SSL",
        "Mobile friendly design",
        "Contact form",
        "Basic SEO",
        "Content updates",
      ],
    },
    {
      heading: "What is not included",
      items: [
        "Full mailbox hosting is not included. Email forwarding is included; a full mailbox service is not part of a website plan.",
        "Advertising spend is not included in a website plan. See the Ads Pack below for advertising.",
        "Anything not listed in the included list above should be treated as not included until confirmed in writing.",
      ],
    },
    {
      heading: "The Ads Pack, separate from website plans",
      body: "The Ads Pack is a standalone advertising service, not a website plan.",
      items: [
        "C$899.99 per month",
        "C$499.99 one time setup fee",
        "Client ad spend from C$1,500 per month, paid on the client's own card",
        "Ad spend goes to the advertising platform, not to Webao, and it is separate from the Ads Pack fee.",
      ],
    },
    {
      heading: "How to start",
      items: [
        "Go to /start and describe the business and the site you need.",
        "Pick a plan, or ask which plan fits the site you described.",
        "Webao builds the custom site, then looks after it under the plan.",
