    },
    {
      q: "What is included, and what is not included?",
      a: "A website plan includes a domain, hosting, SSL, mobile friendly design, a contact form, basic SEO, and content updates. Full mailbox hosting is not included: email forwarding is included, and a full mailbox service is not part of a website plan. Advertising spend is not included in a website plan. Anything not listed as included should be treated as not included until confirmed in writing.",
    },
    {
      q: "How do I start?",
